{"id":"qa_dd6e34f93d75","messages":[{"content":"仅依据提供的资料回答；资料不足时说明缺少的信息。","role":"system"},{"content":"资料：\n智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。机组由冷媒回路、循环水泵、控制主板与远程告警模块组成。额定冷却能力为 9.0 kW，工作电源为三相 AC 380 V / 50 Hz。出厂默认将过温保护阈值设置为 65℃，用户可在 45℃ 至 80℃ 之间调整。\n\n本手册覆盖启动前检查、日常运行、过温告警处理与月度维护。操作人员须持有设备主管部门颁发的特种设备作业证，且在近 12 个月内完成复训。\n\n问题：请根据给定资料说明该规定的具体要求是什么？","role":"user"},{"content":"智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。","role":"assistant"}],"metadata":{"chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","data_stage":"released","evidence":"智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。","evidence_state":"sufficient","expected_action":"answer","family_id":"qfam_6bb1aad7429fdbc055bb","filter_trace":{"evidence_substring":{"action":"pass","ok":true},"grading":{"grade":"A","mode":"validity_tier","role":"learning"},"roundtrip":{"mean":1.0,"ok":true,"sims":[1.0,1.0,1.0]},"rule_clean":{"action":"pass"},"selfcheck":{"skipped":true}},"generation_route":"direct_grounded","generation_trace":{"anchor":"","cot_enabled":false,"evol_level":0,"evolution_type":null,"generation_route":"direct_grounded","generation_timestamp":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142708+00:00","hard":false,"operation":"reuse_candidate","q_type":"factual","reused_candidate":true,"teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b","verification_status":null},"goal":"rag_grounded","grade":"A","intent_primary":"lookup_explain","judge_overall":null,"judge_scores":{},"kb_gain":null,"kind":"事实问答","location":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","nli_score":null,"parent_id":"","q_type":"factual","review_history":[{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142752+00:00","cot":false,"stage":"distillation","strategy":"write","teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b"},{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142759+00:00","reused":true,"stage":"distillation","strategy":"reuse_candidate"},{"action":"pass","at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.199585+00:00","stage":"filter","strategy":"rule_clean"},{"action":"pass","at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.199714+00:00","ok":true,"stage":"filter","strategy":"evidence_substring"},{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.201016+00:00","mean":1