{"id":"qa_301c83becff6","messages":[{"content":"仅依据提供的资料回答；资料不足时说明缺少的信息。","role":"system"},{"content":"资料：\n控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。远程告警模块型号为 ALM-04，通过 RS-485 接入厂级监控，波特率固定为 9600。循环水泵额定流量 4.5 m³/h，扬程 18 m。冷媒回路使用 R134a，禁止混用其他工质。\n\n当控制主板检测到出水温度连续 8 秒高于保护阈值，会向 ALM-04 发送过温告警帧，同时切断压缩机接触器 KM1。切断后水泵继续运行不少于 120 秒，以便带走换热器余热。\n\n问题：请根据给定资料说明该规定的具体要求是什么？","role":"user"},{"content":"控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。","role":"assistant"}],"metadata":{"chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","data_stage":"released","evidence":"控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。","evidence_state":"sufficient","expected_action":"answer","family_id":"","filter_trace":{"evidence_substring":{"action":"pass","ok":true},"grading":{"grade":"A","mode":"validity_tier","role":"learning"},"roundtrip":{"mean":1.0,"ok":true,"sims":[1.0,1.0,1.0]},"rule_clean":{"action":"pass"},"selfcheck":{"skipped":true}},"generation_route":"direct_grounded","generation_trace":{"anchor":"","cot_enabled":false,"evol_level":0,"evolution_type":null,"generation_route":"direct_grounded","generation_timestamp":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142795+00:00","hard":false,"operation":"reuse_candidate","q_type":"factual","reused_candidate":true,"teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b","verification_status":null},"goal":"rag_grounded","grade":"A","intent_primary":"lookup_explain","judge_overall":null,"judge_scores":{},"kb_gain":null,"kind":"事实问答","location":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","nli_score":null,"parent_id":"","q_type":"factual","review_history":[{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142822+00:00","cot":false,"stage":"distillation","strategy":"write","teacher_model":"qwen3.8-27b"},{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.142827+00:00","reused":true,"stage":"distillation","strategy":"reuse_candidate"},{"action":"pass","at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.199610+00:00","stage":"filter","strategy":"rule_clean"},{"action":"pass","at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.199733+00:00","ok":true,"stage":"filter","strategy":"evidence_substring"},{"at":"2026-10-07T07:53:31.202456+00:00","mean":1.0,"o